GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/zt_risk_scoring/{user_id}
Retrieves the detailed risk score breakdown for a specific user, including contributing factors.
Required: account_id (path); user_id (path)

DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/zt_risk_scoring/integrations/{integration_id}
Removes a Zero Trust risk score integration, disconnecting the external risk signal source.
Required: account_id (path); integration_id (path)

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/zt_risk_scoring/integrations/{integration_id}
Gets a Zero Trust risk score integration by ID.
Required: account_id (path); integration_id (path)

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/zt_risk_scoring/integrations/reference_id/{reference_id}
Retrieves a Zero Trust risk score integration using its external reference ID.
Required: account_id (path); reference_id (path)

PUT /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/zt_risk_scoring/integrations/{integration_id}
Overwrite the reference_id, tenant_url, and active values with the ones provided.
Required: account_id (path); integration_id (path); body (body)
